    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Education",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S5562A\n\nSPONSOR: KAMINSKY\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act relating to legalizing, validating, ratifying and confirming\ntransportation contracts for the West Hempstead Union Free school\ndistrict\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nTo provide a deadline waiver to the West Hempstead Union Free School\nDistrict so that they may receive reimbursement for a bus transportation\ncontract from the State Education Department.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 amends Paragraph a of subdivision 5 of section 3604 of the\neducation law.\n\nSection 2 directs the State Education Department to consider the specif-\nic contracts indicated in Section 1 of the bill.\n\nSection 3 sets the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis bill allows the State Education Department to consider reimburse-\nment for several school bus transportation contracts for the West Hemp-\nstead Union Free School District. Specifically, the contracts addressed\nin the bill are E252155, E276674, C415912, E272281, C415916, E252157,\nC515014, E252153,\nC415915,E276672,C415913,E275266,C515015,C415914,E276668,E260973,\nE272280,E275265,C515016,E272278,E272277,E275268,E276670,E2773089,\nE276669,C515017,E276667,E611132,E267596,E270763,E272275,E275271,\nE272283,E272285and E275267 from the 2017-2018 schoolyear.\n\nThe contracts are for legitimate student transportation costs incurred\nby the district and is a reimbursable expense through the State Educa-\ntion Department. The aid cannot be reimbursed without special legis-\nlation due to technical errors in filing deadlines. Without the restora-\ntion of this transportation aid, the school district would be faced with\neither cutting the quality and scope of its educational programs or\nraising real property taxes. This would place an undue burden on\ndistrict residents and present hardships to many in the West Hempstead\ncommunity.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nTBD\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
